        "accordion_kjtkyw": {
          "type": "accordion",
          "settings": {
            "question": "Ingredients",
            "answer": "<p>Alcohol Denat., Parfum, Aqua, Pogostemon Cablin Oil, Vanillin, Citronellol, Citrus Aurantium Bergamia Peel Oil, Ethylhexyl Salicylate, Limonene, Linalool, Butyl Methoxydibenzoylmethane, Linalyl Acetate, Pinene, Beta-Caryophyllene, Pelargonium Graveolens Flower Oil, Rose Flower Oil/Extract, Geraniol, Rose Ketones, Geranyl Acetate, Camphor, Citral, Alcohol, Terpineol, Terpinolene, Tris(Tetramethylhydroxypiperidinol) Citrate, Alpha-Terpinene, Benzyl Benzoate, Farnesol<br/><br/>Flammable product<br/><br/>For external use only</p>"
          }
        },
        "accordion_xFKLgk": {
          "type": "accordion",
          "settings": {
            "question": "Instructions",
            "answer": "<p>To fully enjoy your olfactory experience and ensure safe use, here are a few tips.<br/><br/>USAGE PRECAUTIONS<br/><br/>•\tHold the bottle about 30 cm (12 inches) away from the skin for optimal and even diffusion.<br/><br/>•\tAvoid delicate or light-colored fabrics to prevent stains.<br/><br/>•\tDo not spray directly onto eyes, mucous membranes, or irritated skin.<br/><br/>•\tIf you have sensitive skin, perform a preliminary test by applying a small amount to the inside of your wrist before regular use.<br/><br/>APPLICATION AND DIFFUSION<br/><br/>•\tSpray the perfume on pulse points (wrists, behind the ears, base of the neck): the warmth of these areas intensifies the diffusion of the notes.<br/><br/>•\tAvoid rubbing your wrists together after application to preserve the purity of the olfactory accords.<br/><br/>•\tApply the perfume to clean, slightly moisturized skin for longer-lasting wear.<br/><br/>STORING YOUR PERFUME<br/><br/>•\tStore your bottle in a cool place, away from direct light, temperature variations, and humidity, to maintain the quality of your fragrance.</p>"
          }
        },
        "accordion_pwHj6M": {
          "type": "accordion",
          "settings": {
            "question": "Delivery",
            "answer": "<p>Complimentary shipping from:<br/><br/>• €50 in France and within the European Union (with exceptions)<br/><br/>• €60 in Switzerland<br/><br/>• €100 internationally<br/><br/>For more information, please refer to our shipping and returns page.</p>"
          }
        }
      },
